  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Job and STEM Skills for Rural Youth in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Community Learning Center located in the Northeast of Guatemala will receive 50 youth at a time and serve as a STEM/ Job readiness training center.  Fundacrea provides scholarships for youth to graduate high school, but they are not getting hired because they lack the technical and soft skills required in the workplace.  Our team of Technology, English, and technical training partners will support youth to be job-ready or advance to college and have a brighter future.</narrative>
  </description>
